{"reviews":[{"id":"B0787HPL6D-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!!","x":"So fun and easy to use. Shows up well even on dark hair. Doesn't necessarily wash out completely the first time but doesn't last longer than two washes. Love these!!","h":25,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-1","r":5.0,"t":"Works great on fair hair!","x":"My nine-year-old used this herself. Bright vibrant colors, BUT she has very light blond hair. Washed out easily and completely with regular shampoo.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-2","r":1.0,"t":"Stick & greasy like a lipstick","x":"These are like lipsticks. They wear down very fast. Pretty much a one time use. They make your hair greasy, dark, and sticky. The feeling is simply awful.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great colors","x":"Best hair chalk I\u2019ve tried. Easily applies to hair and hair can be brushed after hair chalk was applied. Color stays pretty good through out the day. May take several washes for color to come out completely","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-4","r":5.0,"t":"So much fun, so easy to use.","x":"Great vibrant colors, easy to use, and washes out right way.  I've used this on my professional colored platinum blonde hair, and on my sons natural blonde hair. I've used ALL the colors including black and they always wash out.  When the product is in your hair, it adds texture and thickness so dont expect soft flowing hair,... looks amazing styled.  Also if you keep touching your hair you may get some color transfer on your hands or clothes if you have long hair.  I like using these for spirit","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-5","r":1.0,"t":"Didn't work well","x":"I really wanted to like these. They did not dry down in my sons hair. It was very messy and did not show up well. His hair is light brown, maybe if he had blonde hair it would have worked better. We tried to dry it with the hair dryer but it didnt work. He wasn't able to sit or lay down on anything and his hair was so matted you couldn't get a comb through it. Disappointed.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-6","r":2.0,"t":"It\u2019s just ok.","x":"I didn\u2019t like the greasy pens.  It\u2019s difficult to put on and not very vibrant.  Not much product in each color.  Works best on blonde.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-7","r":4.0,"t":"Colorful, easy to apply, fades fast","x":"Easy to apply.  Most Colors visible on very dark hair.  Came out really really fast. 8 am \u2014 unicorn lunch time \u2014 plain Jane but still very fun.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-8","r":5.0,"t":"So fun","x":"These hair chalks are so fun.  The go on very easily and wash right out with your next shampoo.  The colors are vibrant and clear.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-9","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"AWSOME AWESOME AWSOME AWESOME AWESOME AWSOME AWESOME AWSOME AWESOME AWSOME AWESOME AWSOME AWESOME","h":5,"v":0,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-10","r":5.0,"t":"So much fun! I got lots of compliments","x":"So much fun!  I got lots of compliments!  It colored and stayed in well!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great colors and easy to use!","x":"We love this product! Easy to use and looks great. Washes out easily with one wash. My daughters (3 & 7) and even my son (7) use them on each other - or let mom have some fun and create crazy hair dos for them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-12","r":4.0,"t":"Awesome for kids, but it transfers easily.","x":"Awesome hair color for kids!  My only complaint is that whatever comes in contact with the hair the color will transfer!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-13","r":5.0,"t":"Fun for little girls","x":"Gift for my nieces (ages 6-8) and they all loved it!  It was easy to apply and the colors showed up on dark hair!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-14","r":5.0,"t":"Love","x":"Finally found temporary chalk that works on dark hair. My daughter has brown hair and they show up beautifully.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-15","r":3.0,"t":"Okay Color","x":"It\u2019s okay but careful how much use, it makes your hair greasy looking.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-16","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"I would not buy these again. They're wet and clumpy in your hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-17","r":3.0,"t":"Messy.","x":"Does not come off easily. Tip breaks when applying pressure.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-18","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"Lots of great colors, isn\u2019t chalky and washes out easily.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-19","r":4.0,"t":"Great non-permanent hair color!","x":"My son wanted to dye his hair blue - ummmm no.  Hair chalk was the perfect compromise.  It adds as much or as little color as you want.  It lasts one day - I would recommend washing it out each night or you will wake up with it all over your pillow.  Super easy to apply - you can add in different shades of the same color to add dimension, do all the same color, or add as many colors are you like.  I love that this gives my kids the freedom to make their hair original but isn't permanent and does","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-20","r":4.0,"t":"Fun, but don't trust the manufacturer's photos","x":"Your hair will never look as vibrant as the seller's photos. Just accept that. Those were definitely NOT done with hair chalk.  That being said, these are still tons of fun to use, and I've enjoyed painting my husband's silver hair in rainbow colors. :)  Check out the images that reviewers have posted to get an idea of how they really look in both dark and light hair.  The chalk will make your hair feel a little gummy, and the colors will rub off on pillows, etc., but it washes out easily.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-21","r":2.0,"t":"Lipstick for the hair","x":"They are basically oil pastels or lipsticks. I purchased them for my five yo and she has dark, very sleek straight hair. I find them hard to apply because you are trying to rub lipstick on your hair basically, the hair doesn\u2019t stay there for you to apply the color. the colors don\u2019t show much on her hair and if I rub more, it clumps up and becomes greasy. The only good part was they wash out well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-22","r":2.0,"t":"Not suitable for dark hair","x":"The product is easy to use and the pack comes with a lot of color options for a reasonable price. I have dark brown hair and I used an entire stick in my hair and the color was almost non existent. This is definitely not ideal for someone with dark brown hair. I tried both green colors and neither of them showed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-23","r":5.0,"t":"Fun and simple to use","x":"Fun and easy enough for my 5 year old to use independently! My kids can color stripes in their hair and draw designs on on their faces without worry of a huge mess. The color washes out of hair within a couple washings (from blonde hair) and easily comes off skin with a wet cloth. We will order them again!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0787HPL6D-24","r":2.0,"t":"Not good for dark hair","x":"This product does not work good on dark hair. It was very easy to wash out though. I put a low rating for value because it did not work good on dark brown hair. It was also difficult to apply onto hair due to the fact that it is like a crayon and you have to color on hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the hair chalk fun and easy to apply, with vibrant colors.","cites":[1,2,4,5,9,11,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the color washes out easily, though some note it may take more than one wash to fully come out.","cites":[1,2,4,5,9,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the product feels greasy, sticky, or messy and transfers onto surfaces.","cites":[3,6,7,13]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers note the chalk works best or only shows up well on blonde or light hair, while others say it shows up on dark hair too.","cites":[2,6,7,8,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the color fades or wears down quickly.","cites":[3,8]}]},"qa":[]}